<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. The custom fonts of an account, password or utility page
  section, printed into the section root's style attribute: the theme's own
  font variables, redefined inside the section, so the theme's priority
  rules (snippets/theme-controls) draw the picked fonts and the theme's
  fonts come back when the switch is off. The @font-face rules are printed
  by account-pages-font-face. Only the sections listed in
  account-pages-base render it.

  Params: st (section.settings, with enable_custom_fonts, heading_font, body_font)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if st.enable_custom_fonts -%}
  {%- if st.heading_font.family != blank -%}--heading-font: {{ st.heading_font.family }}, {{ st.heading_font.fallback_families }};{%- endif -%}
  {%- if st.body_font.family != blank -%}--body-font: {{ st.body_font.family }}, {{ st.body_font.fallback_families }}; --mb-font: {{ st.body_font.family }}, {{ st.body_font.fallback_families }};{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
</template>
